                    30. See <hi rendition="#italic">ante</hi>, <ref target="#pg494">pp. 494</ref>,
                        <ref target="#pg498">498</ref>. This proposal was apparently withdrawn by
                    Stalin at the Eleventh Plenary Meeting, July 31. See <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >ante</hi>, <ref target="#pg525">pp. 525 (footnote 46)</ref>, <ref
                        target="#pg537">537</ref>.</p>
            </note>
